    "text": "Man Killed in Wild Elephant Attack \u2013 Settikulam Police Division",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.5600004196167
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      107.42,
      61.55,
      526.19,
      102.45
    ],
    "text": "The Settikulam Police have launched an investigation following a report received on the evening of 25 July 2026 that a man had been killed in a wild elephant attack in the Anawilundawa area within the Settikulam Police Division.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      107.42,
      116.89,
      472.06,
      130.17
    ],
    "text": "The deceased has been identified as a 58-year-old resident of Neriyakulam.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      107.42,
      144.73,
      526.32,
      171.81
    ],
    "text": "Preliminary investigations have revealed that the victim was attacked by a wild elephant near the Anawilundawa tank embankment.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      107.42,
      186.25,
      438.7,
      199.53
    ],
    "text": "Further investigations are being conducted by the Settikulam Police.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
