      107.42,
      527.34,
      526.41,
      568.22
    ],
    "text": "On the morning of 25 July 2026, officers attached to the Bagawanthalawa Police Station conducted a raid in the Kotiyagala area following a tip-off and arrested three suspects allegedly engaged in unauthorised gem mining.",
    "fonts": [
