    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      107.42,
      500.34,
      526.4,
      541.22
    ],
    "text": "On the evening of 25 July 2026, officers attached to the Kompannaweediya Police Station conducted a raid in the parking area of a restaurant within the Company Street Police Division following a tip-off.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      107.42,
      555.66,
      526.38,
      596.57
    ],
    "text": "During the operation, police arrested a 30-year-old Malaysian national who was found in possession of 36,200 illicit cigarettes. A cab allegedly used in connection with the offence was also taken into police custody.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      107.42,
      611.13,
      526.26,
      638.21
    ],
    "text": "The suspect has been handed over for further legal proceedings, while the seized cigarettes and vehicle have been retained as evidence.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      107.42,
      652.65,
      466.78,
      665.93
    ],
    "text": "Further investigations are being carried out by the Company Street Police.",
